# Optional local overrides for Firebase Functions deploy.
# Stock catalog sync: NEVER set STOCK_CATALOG_SYNC_ENABLED=true in env.
# Sync is hardcoded OFF in stock-api-secrets.ts. Scheduled sync is forbidden.
# See docs/billing-cost-guards.md
# Manual sync only via Warehouse Backoffice → Stock API Sync.
# Secrets (set in Firebase console / Secret Manager): STOCK_SYNC_API_TOKEN, WASENDER_API_KEY, etc.
